<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">The Cognitive Bandwidth Bottleneck:
<br class="ltx_break">Shifting Long-Horizon Agent from Planning with Actions to Planning with Schemas</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
